hasDbXref \"PMID:37426070\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.stem.2023.11.013\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_0000121 \"Neurodegenerative disorders affecting Purkinje cells disrupt motor functions. Some of the neurodegenerative disorders that causes loss and degeration of Purkinje cells are Spinocerebellar ataxias (SCAs) (Josef P Kapfhammer and Etsuko Shimobayashi 2023), Friedreich's ataxia (FRDA) (Kevin C Kemp et al., 2016), Fetal alcohol syndrome (Laurent Servais et al., 2016), Dandy-Walker malformation (Alexander Atamian et al., 2024).\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_0000121 \"Purkinje cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/>) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1016/j.cnp.2022.11.002\") foaf:depiction obo:CL_0000121 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/images/CB_circuits_PMID3650468_f2.png>)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(dc:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/>) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.3389/fnins.2020.00293\") foaf:depiction obo:CL_0000121 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl/images/Candelabrum_cell.jpg>)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_0000121 obo:CL_0000540)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_0000121 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002100 obo:UBERON_0002979))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_0000121 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0061534))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_0000122 (stellate neuron)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:9780123973481\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_0000122 \"A neuron that has dendritic processes radiating from the cell body forming a star-like shape.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasDbXref obo:CL_0000122 \"BTO:0002316\")\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
